<title>USA: SCHMITT SETS 250,000 SHR BUYBACK.</title>
<headline>SCHMITT SETS 250,000 SHR BUYBACK.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schmitt Industries Inc Thursday said its board of directors has authorized a company stock repurchase program of up to 250,000 shares in the open market.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe that buying back our shares is a good investment for the company and its shareholders and supports our belief in our long-term growth prospects,&quot; Wayne Case, president, said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company has 7.1 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
